        # === DIRECTIONAL WEATHERING SET ===================================
        # Streaking authored as MATERIAL, not as painted geometry. Each of these is a
        # cutout-opacity look whose alpha comes from a run/wash mask stretched hard in
        # v, so the stain is shaped like gravity, not like a decal. 20_architecture
        # applies them to thin vertical bands that START at a fixing, a bolt line, a
        # gutter mouth or a sill and run DOWN. Bind list is in the header table.
        #
        # Heavy rust bleed straight off a fixing: narrow, saturated, opaque at the top.
        def Material "A_StreakRust_0"
        {
            token outputs:mdl:surface.connect = </World/Looks/A_StreakRust_0/Shader.outputs:out>
            token outputs:surface.connect = </World/Looks/A_StreakRust_0/Preview.outputs:surface>

